{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02496","headline":"玄武门侍宴 · 杜正伦","name":"玄武门侍宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君端扆暇，睿赏狎林泉。\n开轩临禁籞，藉野列芳筵。\n参差歌管扬，容裔羽旗悬。\n玉池流若醴，云阁聚非烟。\n湛露曦尧日，熏风入舜弦。\n大德侔玄造，微物荷陶甄。\n谬陪瑶水宴，仍厕栢梁篇。\n阚名徒上月，邹辩讵谈天。\n既喜光华旦，还伤迟暮年。\n犹冀升中日，簪裾奉肃然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜正伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}